ht_lens vendor directory — third-party licenses
================================================

This directory contains pre-built ES module bundles downloaded from
the upstream projects, vendored into the repo so the static viewer
works without a build step or a runtime CDN dependency.

The originals were obtained from jsDelivr CDN and are unmodified.

---

